            <div class="chunk-card"><div class="img-container"><img src="./img/start_the_lesson.png" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/400x400/FF8FA3/FFF?text=Img+5'"></div><div class="note-area light"><div class="note-line"></div><div class="note-margin"></div><div class="note-text-wrap"><h3>start the lesson</h3><span>시작하다 수업을</span></div></div></div>
